{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9HZXJtYW4tTGFuZ3VhZ2UvRGVyJTIwU3RhYXQlMjBnZWdlbiUyMEZyaXR6JTIwQmF1ZXIlMjAlMjgyMDE1JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Der Staat gegen Fritz Bauer","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/jufmPUcwJYCRJe2q3pgAP0IavhC.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eG69D0ftcKmYeCKCIkzLbKihTva.jpg","description":"It is the late 1950s. Flourishing under the economic miracle, Germany grows increasingly apathetic about confronting the horrors of its recent past. Nevertheless, Fritz Bauer doggedly devotes his energies to bringing the Third Reich to justice. One day Bauer receives a letter from Argentina, written by a man who is certain that his daughter is dating the son of Adolph Eichmann. Excited by the promising lead, and mistrustful of a corrupt judiciary system where Nazis still lurk, Bauer journeys to Jerusalem to seek alliance with Mossad, the Israeli secret service. To do so is treason — yet committing treason is the only way Bauer can serve his country.\n\nReleased 13 Sept 2015 · Germany · Language: German · 105 min\nStudio: Zero One Film, Terz Film, ARTE\n\nOn your server — Audio: German","releaseInfo":"2015","genres":["History","Drama","Mystery","Others"],"imdbRating":"6.8","runtime":"105 min","cast":["Burghart Klaußner","Ronald Zehrfeld","Sebastian Blomberg","Jörg Schüttauf","Lilith Stangenberg","Laura Tonke","Götz Schubert","Cornelia Gröschel"],"director":["Lars Kraume"],"released":"2015-09-13T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Lars Kraume","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yfgp1UxWJugexQ9vuSqSN67XYL2.jpg"},{"name":"Burghart Klaußner","character":"Fritz Bauer","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fRRo8H3zqvKJxyId4ECQeKqYFwM.jpg"},{"name":"Ronald Zehrfeld","character":"Karl Angermann","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cl76qf5nskBoD1q7WWajH3LdPV0.jpg"},{"name":"Sebastian Blomberg","character":"Ulrich Kreidler","photo":"https: